window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Some lines weren’t meant to be crossed. Others were just waiting.</p> <p>Two different stories. Too close to stop. <i>Nothing Between Us</i> is a haunting double portrait of forbidden intimacy, where love crosses boundaries, and shared silence speaks louder than denial. Each story unravels in soft heat and whispered tension, tracing the line between want and wrong.</p>"; 
